msgid "Independent JA/EN maintenance"
msgstr "JA/EN の独立したメンテナンス"

#: ../../decisions/0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md
msgid "Compatibility with ADR-0002 deployment"
msgstr "ADR-0002 デプロイとの互換性"

#: ../../decisions/0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md
msgid "Zero-cost / GitHub-native"
msgstr "ゼロコスト / GitHub ネイティブ"

#: ../../decisions/0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md
