msgstr "作成のエルゴノミクス"

#: ../../decisions/0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md
msgid "Low build-time impact"
msgstr "ビルド時間への低影響"

#: ../../decisions/0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md:135
msgid "Links"
msgstr "リンク"

